  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GFDRR Civil Society Partnership Strategy - Online Mapping Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the online platform is to create a sustainable map driven information database of civil society DRR actors to strengthen the ability of the DRR community to engage in collaboration, networking, partnerships, shared actions and knowledge with allactors concerned with building resilience. The aim of the exercise is to provide a comprehensive and easily accessible global database of civil society actors engaged in DRR. The target audience for the online platform is government officials, policy makers, donors, development organizations, civil society practitioners, and other stakeholders engaged in DRR.     The key indicator of success will be the creation of an estabilished online platform and sustainable tool that maps global CSO engagement in DRR.</narrative>
  </description>
